{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我　朝　　　世宗憲皇帝云：直將阿彌陀佛四字作句話頭，\n一念萬年，自然摸著鼻孔。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "花嚴極樂，極樂花嚴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "似有永明在目。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靈復曰：絕似鏡影鐘聲諸作。"}
